<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Radio cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Radio cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Advanced Radio Telecom Corp to long-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- said kept Advanced Radio as intermediate-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Advanced Radio lost 3/4 to 8-1/4 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
